WEBVTT

00:02:26.726 --> 00:02:31.856
Amal is a 3.5-meter puppet
created by Handspring Puppet Company,

00:02:31.898 --> 00:02:34.400
the renowned puppet company
from South Africa.

00:02:35.109 --> 00:02:38.571
"The Walk" will start
in the border of Syria-Turkey,

00:02:38.571 --> 00:02:40.323
in a city called Gaziantep.

00:02:40.364 --> 00:02:43.826
We will make our way
through Turkey and into Greece,

00:02:43.868 --> 00:02:45.703
then from Greece to Italy,

00:02:45.745 --> 00:02:47.914
from Italy to southern France,

00:02:47.914 --> 00:02:51.417
then through Switzerland
to Germany, Belgium,

00:02:51.417 --> 00:02:52.960
and back to northern France,

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.337
across the English Channel

00:02:54.337 --> 00:02:57.089
and then from Dover
all the way up to Manchester.

00:02:57.465 --> 00:02:59.967
In order for Amal to make her journey,

00:02:59.967 --> 00:03:02.637
Amal has three sets
of puppeteers to walk her,